sdvm-f: x / y and x % y, signed, for x from -999 to 999 and y from -999 to 999 but not 0.
Cells 28-98. To call it, put y in cell 54, load x into the accumulator and JMP 28.
It returns the quotient x / y in the accumulator and the remainder x % y in cell 53.
It overwrites its own cells and cell 99, including y in cell 54 (made |y|).
Size 71 cells. It runs at most 304 instructions, 50.3 on average, counted from cell 28 to the return jump in cell 98.
Exact over the domain.

